  "content": "\n\n<p>这是一个为 Sophisticated 系列模组（Sophisticated Backpacks 与 Sophisticated Storage）提供基础支持的库模组。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fZNxRYScDS7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/810643286511190016?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&label=Discord&labelColor=FFFFFF&color=5865F2\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fP3pp3rF1y\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/P3pp3rf1y-FFFFFF?style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=000000&label=Twitter&labelColor=FFFFFF&color=202020\" alt=\"Twitter Badge\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/P3pp3rF1y\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/P3pp3rf1y-FFFFFF?style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=000000&label=GitHub&labelColor=FFFFFF&color=202020\" alt=\"GitHub Badge\"></a>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fp3pp3rf1y\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/P3pp3rf1y-FFFFFF?style=for-the-badge&logo=kofi&label=Ko-Fi&labelColor=FFFFFF&color=202020\" alt=\"Ko-Fi Badge\"></a></p>\n<p>它为 Sophisticated 系列模组提供通用功能，主要包括：</p>\n<p>- 通用的升级项功能</p>\n<p>- Sophisticated 模组的容器交互处理</p>\n<p>- 允许操作升级项及相关容器的 GUI 逻辑</p>\n<p>- 升级项的渲染</p>\n<p>- 通用存储设置</p>\n<p>- 在物品提示（Tooltip）中渲染存储物品堆的内容</p>\n<p>- 通用的暂存物品堆逻辑</p>\n<p>该模组理论上可单独用于整合包，但除经验液（Experience Fluid）外，不会在游戏中为玩家提供任何可见内容。其主要用途是作为 Sophisticated 系列模组的依赖库。</p>",
